    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an Empire, From Scratch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratch cards, earn points, and grow your empire in this idle/incremental game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your cards, unlock automation, prestige across industries, and climb the leaderboards.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Upgrades \u2013 Boost your point gain, match multipliers, grid size, and so much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige for Progress \u2013 Reset to climb faster across deep progression layers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements with Rewards \u2013 Earn Gold and multipliers by completing fun challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Leaderboards \u2013 Compete with others across the world across a variety of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable Offline \u2013 Play anywhere anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Ads. No Wait Timers. Just Progress and Big Numbers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
